<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT PORTUGAL 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE BEAT PORTUGAL 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine beat Portugal 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup group nine qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ukraine - Serhiy Popov (5th), Yuri Maksimov (88th)</p>
<p>Portugal - Luis Figo (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000  </p>
<p>Group nine standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Ukraine	   2   2   0   0   3   1   6</p>
<p> Armenia	   2   0   2   0   1   1   2</p>
<p> NorthernIreland 2   0   1   1   1   2   1</p>
<p> Portugal	  2   0   1   1   1   2   1</p>
<p> Albania	   -   -   -   -   -   -   -</p>
<p> Germany	   -   -   -   -   -   -   -</p>
<p>Next matches: Oct 9 - Armenia v Germany, Albania v Portugal</p>
</text>
